        "pattern": "by far (with a comparative/superlative)",
        "meaning_cn": "大大地；远远地（强调比较差距）",
        "definition_en": "by a large degree or difference",
        "level": "L2",
        "pos": "phrase",
        "direction": "R+P",
        "boundary": "与比较级或最高级搭配强调程度差距，如 better by far/by far the best；不是“通过某种方式”。",
        "source": "https://www.oxfordlearnersdictionaries.com/definition/english/by_1"
      },
