        "pattern": "by no means",
        "meaning_cn": "绝不；一点也不",
        "definition_en": "not at all; in no way",
        "level": "L2",
        "pos": "phrase",
        "direction": "R+P",
        "boundary": "整体作强调否定表达；不是在列举某种方法。与字面 means/method 读法区分。",
        "source": "https://www.oxfordlearnersdictionaries.com/definition/english/means"
